> base::assign(".ptime", proc.time(), pos = "CheckExEnv")
> ### Name: adm
> ### Title: Average Distance to the Median
> ### Aliases: adm
> ### Keywords: robust univar
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> adm(c(1:9))
[1] 2.785143
> 
> x <- c(1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 8)
> adm(x)                      # with consistency constant
[1] 2.9244
> adm(x, constant = 1)        # raw mean absolute deviation
[1] 2.333333
> 
> # Supply a known center
> adm(x, center = 4.0)
[1] 2.9244
> 
> 
> 
